From 5dd42d711dd069929d4666c51dc63e7d1e6a9dc6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yifengling0 <yifengling0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 02:42:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] test: add cross-queue D3D12 microtest

---
 tests/meson.build                  |   7 +
 tests/vkd3d_multiqueue_microtest.c | 467 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 474 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 tests/vkd3d_multiqueue_microtest.c

diff --git a/tests/meson.build b/tests/meson.build
